  "body": "I wonder do we have a good reason to apply `!important` to `object-fit: contain` in the UA style sheet?\n\nI think there are reasonable cases that authors may want to make the content of element stretch to fill the whole screen.\n\nProbably we can remove `!important` from `object-fit: contain`?\n",
